Third-party notices

Parts of the change-control gates are borrowed or adapted from other MIT
licensed projects, as their source headers state:

- Shell reading (plugins/loopkeeper/hooks/lib/shell.ts): borrowed VERBATIM
  from hamzafer/claude-code-mods, mods/merge-gate/hooks/register.tsx
  (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hamza Zafar).

- Files a Bash command writes (plugins/loopkeeper/hooks/lib/gateRules.ts):
  adapted from yash-gadodia/claude-mods scope-guard
  (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Yash Gadodia): heredoc bodies and quoted strings
  blanked, then sed -i, a redirection, tee, cp/mv's destination and touch read
  for targets. `rm` and the cwd-relative result are ours.

Parts of lk-pr-watch are borrowed from another MIT licensed project, as the
source headers of plugins/lk-pr-watch/hooks/pr.ts and hooks/register.ts state:

- The GraphQL poll, the check buckets, the lineage key, latestPerName, clean(),
  linkable(), the poll diff and the bare-URL prompt handling: borrowed from
  sezaakgun/cc-pr-tracker (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Seza Akgün).
